msgid "What happens next?"
msgstr ""

#: /Users/dusanstojanovic/Projects/nma/ui/datasets/templates/semantic-ui/datasets/DepositCreate.jinja:50
msgid ""
"If the dataset is already in the NMD, we issue the RIV link immediately. "
"No further action is needed."
msgstr ""

#: /Users/dusanstojanovic/Projects/nma/ui/datasets/templates/semantic-ui/datasets/DepositCreate.jinja:51
msgid ""
"If the dataset is not in the NMD, we attempt to automatically retrieve "
